  "citation": "Mungunchimeg Chultemsuren,Soo-Jin Song,Ki-Hwan Han,Jung-A Shin.(2025). Iron Overload Accelerates Aging-Associated Kidney Injury in Mice: Implications for Iron Supplementation in the Elderly. Nutrients17:2580.",
